{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"3277","artifact_type":"code-review","name":"S6-code-review-T1-bookend-validator-wiring@sha256:fd714b221dd3eafcdc0e75bb5e93e08ca2b906721ac8d88708ed5dd7dbfc9eba"},"owner_reference":"3277","content":"## Code Review \u2014 Plan Pf1e7e555 (backlog #3277), full diff range a00194f25fec502d3d659b7d610369614967251e..HEAD\n\n**Combined verdict: PASS**\n\nReviews T1\u2013T4 of Pf1e7e555 against their acceptance criteria (T0/T5 are bookend gates, not implementation \u2014 out of scope for this review). Files: `sam_schema/core/exceptions.py` (T1), `dh_core/operations.py` (T2), `sam_schema/sam_plan.py` (T3), `tests/test_operations_sam.py` (T4).\n\n### T1 \u2014 BookendValidationError in exceptions.py: PASS\nPure 16-line addition. `class BookendValidationError(SamError)` with exact required docstring; `__all__` entry inserted alphabetically after `\"ArtifactWriteError\"`; `plan_id`/`errors` stored verbatim (no reformatting), message `f\"Plan {plan_id} failed bookend validation: {'; '.join(errors)}\"`. All 4 ACs verified (grep x2, runtime behavior, ruff/ty clean). No other class touched.\n\n### T2 \u2014 Gate wired into dh_core/operations.py: PASS (highest-risk piece \u2014 verified carefully)\n- Imports extended correctly (`BookendValidator`, `BookendValidationError`), no extra model imports added.\n- `create_plan`: validation block sits after `normalized_tasks` is built and before `backend.create_plan(...)` (confirmed by line numbers: raise at 271, backend call at 273). Empty-`normalized_tasks` correctly skips validation (incremental-build path preserved) \u2014 verified by `test_create_plan_succeeds_without_structured_criteria` and by code inspection (`if normalized_tasks:` guard). Transient `Plan` is discarded, never passed to the backend \u2014 backend still builds its own plan from the same locals.\n- `finalize_plan`: calls existing `read_plan()` (preserves `PlanNotFoundError` behavior), skips validation when `state == PlanState.READY` (grandfather clause, confirmed before the `BookendValidator` call), raise at line 723 precedes `backend.finalize_plan(plan)` at 725.\n- `append_task` confirmed untouched \u2014 no `BookendValidator` reference between `def append_task` and `def finalize_plan` (grep-verified).\n- Docstrings updated with `Raises: BookendValidationError`.\n- ruff/ty clean. `tests_sam` full suite: 949 passed, 3 skipped \u2014 no regressions, including `test_drafting_state.py`/`test_cli_create.py` which exercise the gated paths.\n\n### T3 \u2014 CLI except-tuple wiring in sam_plan.py: PASS\n- `BookendValidationError` imported; added to `create`'s except-tuple (line ~292 area) and `finalize`'s except-tuple (line ~541 area). Exactly 3 occurrences (import + 2 tuples), exactly 3 changed lines (git diff --stat: 3 insertions, 3 deletions \u2014 in-place tuple edits).\n- `append-task`'s except-tuple confirmed untouched (grep for \"append\" in the diff returns nothing).\n- `finalize`'s exit-code logic (`2 if isinstance(exc, FormatDetectionError) else 1`) correctly routes `BookendValidationError` to exit code 1, not the `FormatDetectionError` code-2 bucket.\n- ruff/ty clean. `tests_sam/test_cli.py` + `test_cli_create.py`: 59 passed.\n\n### T4 \u2014 Integration tests in tests/test_operations_sam.py: PASS\nNew `TestBookendEnforcement` class, 5 cases, all present and passing:\n1. `test_create_plan_rejects_missing_bookends` \u2014 direct Pb31107bf-shaped reproduction (backlog AC #1/#4).\n2. `test_create_plan_accepts_correct_bookends` \u2014 backlog AC #2.\n3. `test_create_plan_succeeds_without_structured_criteria` \u2014 backlog AC #3.\n4. `test_finalize_plan_rejects_incremental_bookend_gap` \u2014 proves `append_task` stays ungated while `finalize_plan` closes the gap (backlog AC #1/#4).\n5. `test_finalize_plan_is_noop_for_pre_existing_ready_plan` \u2014 grandfather case, writes the non-compliant ready plan directly via `task_provider.create_plan(...)` (below the `dh_core.operations` layer), not through the now-rejecting `create_plan` \u2014 correct per spec.\n\nEvery case calls a `dh_core.operations` function (`create_plan`/`append_task`/`finalize_plan`); `BookendValidator` appears only in the class docstring prose explaining that it is *not* called directly, not in any test body \u2014 satisfies the \"through operations.py, not the validator in isolation\" requirement (backlog AC #5).\n\nVerified: `tests_sam/test_dependencies.py` byte-identical to HEAD and its 49 tests pass unmodified (backlog AC #6). ruff/ty clean on the test file.\n\n### Full-suite regression check\n`uv run -q --locked pytest plugins/development-harness/tests plugins/development-harness/tests_sam -q --no-cov` \u2192 **3926 passed, 42 skipped, 5 xfailed**, no failures.\n\n### Findings\nNone blocking. No security, correctness, or style issues across T1\u2013T4. Environment note only (not a defect): the AC-1 runtime check-command (`uv run python -c \"...\"`) must be run from `plugins/development-harness/`, not the repo root \u2014 `pythonpath` in `pyproject.toml` is pytest-only, not a general `PYTHONPATH`.\n\n### Backlog #3277 acceptance-criteria trace\n| Backlog AC | Status |\n|---|---|\n| #1 rejection on missing/malformed bookends (create/finalize, CLI+MCP) | Satisfied \u2014 T2 gate + T3 CLI wiring, exercised by T4 cases 1 and 4 |\n| #2 correct bookends still succeed | Satisfied \u2014 T4 case 2 |\n| #3 empty structured criteria unaffected | Satisfied \u2014 T4 case 3 |\n| #4 Pb31107bf-shaped reproduction now caught | Satisfied \u2014 T4 cases 1 and 4 |\n| #5 automated test through operations.py | Satisfied \u2014 all 5 T4 cases call `dh_core.operations`, none call `BookendValidator` directly |\n| #6 tests_sam/test_dependencies.py passes unmodified | Satisfied \u2014 byte-identical, 49/49 passing |\n"}